      "mergedPostDetails": "This is especially bad because these worlds won't land in \"Recently updated\" section of Worlds.\n\nE.g. \n\nBlackout by Ostinyo had very recent updates to the game, but the \"Last updated\" date is 1 month old rn.\n\nLuminescent Ledge by Thorinair had an update recently as well, but the date is stuck at 10-2022.\n\nI just tried pushing a new version of one of my old worlds and it's stuck with 2022 date (wrld_a52f7bee-3288-4854-9321-ffcaa3fd5b00)",
